00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:39,320
There is uh linear polarization and circular polarization, which I won't go into simply because my physics is not enough to explain it.

45
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:43,880
Um but these are the this is what you have to do if you have a large movie theater.

